",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Gerbil \\u0026 Other Small Pet Names\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[5,\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#pairs\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Names for Pairs \\u0026 Groups\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[6,\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#faq\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\"}]]}]]}]]}],\\\"$L23\\\",\\\"$L24\\\",\\\"$L25\\\",\\\"$L26\\\",\\\"$L27\\\",\\\"$L28\\\",\\\"$L29\\\",\\\"$L2a\\\",\\\"$L2b\\\",\\\"$L2c\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",\\\"$L2e\\\",\\\"$L2f\\\",\\\"$L30\\\",\\\"$L31\\\",\\\"$L32\\\"]}],\\\"$L33\\\",\\\"$L34\\\",\\\"$L35\\\",\\\"$L36\\\",\\\"$L37\\\",\\\"$L38\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"23:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Small pets have enormous personalities packed into tiny bodies. A \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"66\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/hamster/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Hamster\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"77\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/guinea-pig/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Guinea Pig\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"91\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/gerbil/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Gerbil\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", mouse, or rat may be small in stature, but they deserve names as big as their hearts. This guide celebrates the art of naming the smallest members of our animal families.\\\"]}]\\n24:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Hamster Names 🐹\\\"]}]\\n25:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Hamsters are the clowns of the small pet world — always stuffing cheeks, running wheels at 3 AM, and escaping in the most dramatic ways. Their names should match their chaotic energy. Classic hamster names: \\u003cstrong\\u003eHamtaro\\u003c/strong\\u003e (the anime hamster!), \\u003cstrong\\u003eNibbles\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePeanut\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGizmo\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCheeks\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBiscuit\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSquishy\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n26:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Food names work wonderfully for hamsters: \\u003cstrong\\u003eMochi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eWaffles\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eTofu\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNugget\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDumpling\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePancake\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePopcorn\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNoodle\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Action names for their endless energy: \\u003cstrong\\u003eTurbo\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eZoom\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBolt\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eScooter\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDash\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRocket\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Celebrity hamsters: \\u003cstrong\\u003eBeyoncé\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eHam Solo\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eChewbacca\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eHamlet\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n27:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Guinea Pig Names 🐹\\\"]}]\\n28:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Guinea pigs are vocal, social, and endlessly expressive. Their distinctive 'wheek' sounds and popcorning jumps deserve names full of personality. Popular guinea pig names: \\u003cstrong\\u003ePippin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eWillow\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDaisy\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eOreo\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGinger\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCocoa\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePatches\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Guinea pigs often come in pairs or groups, making themed names especially fun. Royal pairs: \\u003cstrong\\u003eVictoria \\u0026 Albert\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eWill \\u0026 Kate\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCleopatra \\u0026 Caesar\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Food pairs: \\u003cstrong\\u003ePeanut \\u0026 Butter\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCoffee \\u0026 Cream\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMac \\u0026 Cheese\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCookie \\u0026 Cream\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Literary pairs: \\u003cstrong\\u003eFrodo \\u0026 Sam\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSherlock \\u0026 Watson\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRomeo \\u0026 Juliet\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Mouse \\u0026 Rat Names 🐭\\\"]}]\\n2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Mice and rats are among the most intelligent small pets, capable of learning tricks and forming deep bonds with owners. Famous mouse names: \\u003cstrong\\u003eMickey\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMinnie\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eStuart Little\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eFievel\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eJerry\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGus Gus\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDespereaux\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRemy\\u003c/strong\\u003e (from Ratatouille!).\\\"}}]\\n2c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Rats deserve names that honor their intelligence: \\u003cstrong\\u003eEinstein\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eTesla\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNewton\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDarwin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCurie\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSagan\\u003c/stro\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"ng\\u003e. Their long tails and agility inspire: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSpaghetti\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNoodle\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSlinky\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eRope\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Movie rat names: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSplinter\\u003c/strong\\u003e (TMNT), \\u003cstrong\\u003eTempleton\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Charlotte's Web), \\u003cstrong\\u003eRizzo\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Muppets).\\\"}}]\\n2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Gerbil \\u0026 Other Small Pet Names 🐿️\\\"]}]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Gerbils, degus, chinchillas, and other small rodents each have unique charms. Gerbils: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSandy\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDune\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDesert\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDigger\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eTunnels\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Their desert origins inspire: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSahara\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGobi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eOasis\\u003c/strong\\u003e. For degus: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSquirrel\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAcorn\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eNutkin\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n2f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"For {chinchilla}s: \\u003cstrong\\u003eVelvet\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCashmere\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDusty\\u003c/strong\\u003e (for their dust baths!), \\u003cstrong\\u003ePuff\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSilver\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePlush\\u003c/strong\\u003e. They're prized for their incredibly soft fur, so luxury names fit: \\u003cstrong\\u003eChanel\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003ePrada\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eGucci\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCashmere\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSatin\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n30:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Names for Pairs \\u0026 Groups 👥\\\"]}]\\n31:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Since many small pets thrive in pairs, themed duo names are especially popular. Dynamic duos: \\u003cstrong\\u003eBatman \\u0026 Robin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eMario \\u0026 Luigi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eAnna \\u0026 Elsa\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eWoody \\u0026 Buzz\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eLilo \\u0026 Stitch\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Complementary pairs: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSalt \\u0026 Pepper\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eThunder \\u0026 Lightning\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSunny \\u0026 Stormy\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eYin \\u0026 Yang\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Group names for trios or colonies: The Spice Girls (\\u003cstrong\\u003eGinger, Posh, Baby, Scary, Sporty\\u003c/strong\\u003e), The Seven Dwarfs, The Avengers. Musical groups: \\u003cstrong\\u003eFreddie, Brian, John, Roger\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Queen), \\u003cstrong\\u003eJohn, Paul, George, Ringo\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Beatles).\\\"}}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"33:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Should I give my small pet a human name or a pet name?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Both work wonderfully. Human names like Kevin or Susan on tiny pets create delightful humor. Pet-style names like Nibbles or Peanut feel instinctively right. Follow your heart — there are no rules!\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How do I name multiple small pets that look alike?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Use collar colors, personality differences, or subtle marking differences. If truly identical, give them a collective theme name and refer to them as a group — The Nuggets, The Triplets, The Spice Girls.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Do small pets learn their names?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Rats and mice definitely recognize their names with training. Guinea pigs learn the sound of their names, especially associated with food. Hamsters and gerbils are less responsive but still benefit from consistent naming.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What small pet names are trending right now?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Food names dominate sm